# Root-level reference. Real values live in backend/.env (local) and in Render's dashboard (deployed).
# See backend/.env.example for the full list with comments.
#
# Frontend build-time variables (set in Render's static site settings, or as docker build args):
#   API_URL=https://shopkeeper-api.onrender.com     required for build:render
#   SHOW_DEMO_ACCOUNTS=true                          shows one-tap demo sign-in on the login page
